{"id":"430560","name":"油条蛋花汤","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/430560/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"半个"},{"name":"茴香小油条","amount":"三根"},{"name":"娃娃菜芯","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"陈醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适就"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"麻椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菜，西红柿，娃娃菜芯，茴香小油条切斜丁。","img":"images/430560/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水淀粉适量。","img":"images/430560/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"柴鸡蛋两个打散。","img":"images/430560/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"砂锅里适量油烧热，姜蒜炒香。","img":"images/430560/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"西红柿和娃娃菜芯放入稍炒一下。","img":"images/430560/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一碗半开水。","img":"images/430560/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开勾入水淀粉。","img":"images/430560/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油条丁放入。","img":"images/430560/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"开锅鸡蛋液倒打圈淋入，蛋花浮起关火。","img":"images/430560/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量盐，陈醋(米醋也可)，麻椒粉(胡椒粉也可)生抽，香油调味，香菜，小米椒撒入。","img":"images/430560/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅匀盛碗。","img":"images/430560/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/430560/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/430560/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/430560/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}